! _POC-XRLDP RT04(IOL・脇の系統の PE)。XR02(XRd)越しに RT05 と iBGP。お客さまの経路 10.40/16 は BGP だけ。
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.1.4 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis SIDE
!
interface Loopback100
 description CUSTOMER (BGP only)
 ip address 10.40.0.1 255.255.0.0
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description to XR02
 ip address 10.1.4.4 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis SIDE
 isis network point-to-point
 mpls ip
 no shutdown
!
router isis SIDE
 net 49.0002.0100.0000.1004.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
router bgp 65100
 bgp router-id 10.255.1.4
 bgp log-neighbor-changes
 neighbor 10.255.1.5 remote-as 65100
 neighbor 10.255.1.5 update-source Loopback0
 address-family ipv4
  network 10.40.0.0 mask 255.255.0.0
  neighbor 10.255.1.5 activate
 exit-address-family
!
